abstract: "AsiBackbone 7.5.3 is a backward-compatible maintenance patch for the Accountable Systems Infrastructure package family for .NET. It improves package discovery metadata, adds a five-minute evaluator sample, aligns current terminology and release documentation, refreshes project branding and repository tooling, and preserves public APIs, durable schemas, canonical wire values, package IDs, the net10.0 target, and AssemblyVersion 7.0.0.0."
